## Get started {#get-started}

You need two programs: [pixi](https://pixi.sh) and Git. Everything else is installed by pixi. Start from a clone of the MOLONARI1D repository, on the `{{ branch }}` branch:

```bash
git clone -b {{ branch }} {{ main.url }}.git
cd {{ main.name }}
```

